learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-02T05:56:47.933Z","harness:codex","A current item test_runs array is a bounded cache, not the complete evidence ledger. When citing a producing receipt, record its canonical owner and verified history timestamp/hash so pm get --at can reproduce it after normal retention. Keep gate/test expected domains independently declared to expose runtime drift; pin rendered shell commands to literal platform expectations rather than using the renderer under test as the oracle."
